\\\\\\(\\\\\\\\mathbb F_q\\\\\\\\cup\\\\\\\\{\\\\\\\\perp\\\\\\\\}\\\\\\\\), with zero effect at undefined evaluations. Keep declaration names in the existing `\\\\\\\\lean{...}` tags.\\\\n\\\\nClaim 17-2 remains open; this review credits no separate or unmerged repair. I reviewed the final PR scope against the paper and checked-in standards. The clean worktree, remote head, prompt digest, and nine successful CI contexts match this request. No CI rerun or source edit was performed.\\\\n\\\\nNative review binding: 5e1c974f1cc54a82abd25709b015956e abe2d5c42e25b0edbfef6b516039a295ffa81d97 d47e07531cf0ef6bb2f679c77174b42ce7234f9b68a16e952da28f4c1d104dd9\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"state\\\": \\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\n  \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/400#pullrequestreview-5147805296\\\",\\n  \\\"pull_request_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/400\\\",\\n  \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"OWNER\\\",\\n  \\\"_links\\\": {\\n   \\\"html\\\": {\\n    \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/400#pullrequestreview-5147805296\\\"\\n   },\\n   \\\"pull_request\\\": {\\n    \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/400\\\"\\n   }\\n  },\\n  \\\"submitted_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-08T22:48:51Z\\\",\\n  \\\"commit_id\\\": \\\"abe2d5c42e25b0edbfef6b516039a295ffa81d97\\\"\\n }\\n]\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n/home/drx/.cache/mipstarre-dev/watchdog/lanes/pr400.v5-recovery.log:51:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_23\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"python3 -c 'import sys,json; sys.path.insert(0,\\\\\\\"/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/local/bin\\\\\\\"); import gh_common as gh; print(json.dumps({\\\\\\\"comments\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": c[\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"created_at\\\\\\\": c[\\\\\\\"created_at\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\": c[\\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\"]} for c in gh.api(\\\\\\\"issues/400/comments\\\\\\\